pe=\"text\"></span></p><p>code (if any)<span data-emon=\"field\" data-emon-name=\"f1_06[0]\" data-emon-type=\"text\"></span></p><p><span data-emon=\"field\" data-emon-name=\"c1_1[6]\" data-emon-type=\"checkbox\" role=\"checkbox\" data-emon-checked=\"false\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-emon-value=\"7\"></span>Other (see instructions)<span data-emon=\"field\" data-emon-name=\"f1_04[0]\" data-emon-type=\"text\"></span></p><p>3b If on line 3a you checked Partnership or Trust/estate</p><p>this box if you have any foreign partners, owners, or beneficiaries. See instructions<span data-emon=\"field\" data-emon-name=\"c1_2[0]\" data-emon-type=\"checkbox\" role=\"checkbox\" data-emon-checked=\"false\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-emon-value=\"8\"></span></p><p>. . . .</p><p>5 Address (number, street, and apt. or suite no.). See instructions.<span data-emon=\"field\" data-emon-name=\"f1_07[0]\" data-emon-type=\"text\"></span></p><p>Requester's name and address (optional)<span data-emon=\"field\" data-emon-name=\"f1_09[0]\" data-emon-type=\"text\"></span></p><p>6 City, state, and ZIP code<span data-emon=\"field\" data-emon-name=\"f1_08[0]\" data-emon-type=\"text\"></span></p><p>7 List account number(s) here (optional)<span data-emon=\"field\" data-emon-name=\"f1_10[0]\" data-emon-type=\"text\"></span></p><p>Social security number<span data-emon=\"field\" data-emon-name=\"f1_11[0]\" data-emon-type=\"text\"></span><span data-emon=\"field\" data-emon-name=\"f1_12[0]\" data-emon-type=\"text\"></span><span data-emon=\"field\" data-emon-name=\"f1_13[0]\" data-emon-type=\"text\"></span></p><p>Enter your TIN in the appropriate box.</p><p>-</p><p>-</p><p>Employer identification number<span data-emon=\"field\" data-emon-name=\"f1_14[0]\" data-emon-type=\"text\"></span><span data-emon=\"field\" data-emon-name=\"f1_15[0]\" data-emon-type=\"text\"></span></p></main></body></html>", "the W-9's fields");
